{"headword":"חָרֵשׁ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb. </strong>"},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"be silent, dumb, speechless;"}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"be deaf; chiefly poet. <strong>(</strong>NH Pi. <em>make deaf;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܪܶܫ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܚܪܰܫ</span> <em>be dumb, deaf;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">خَرِسَ</span> <em>be dumb, speechless</em>, cf. Assyrian <em>ḫarâšu</em>, <em>restrain</em>, according to Dl<sup>Pr 100</sup>; v. Lag<sup>BN 120</sup><strong>)</strong>—"}],"num":"2."}]},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶחֱרָ֑שׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:3\" href=\"/Psalms.50.3\">ψ 50:3</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּחֱרַשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:1\" href=\"/Psalms.28.1\">ψ 28:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:2\" href=\"/Psalms.83.2\">83:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּחֱרַ֑שׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:22\" href=\"/Psalms.35.22\">ψ 35:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:1\" href=\"/Psalms.109.1\">109:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּחֱרָ֑שׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:13\" href=\"/Psalms.39.13\">ψ 39:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:3\" href=\"/Psalms.39.3\">3</a> fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּחֱרַ֑שְׁנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:16\" href=\"/Micah.7.16\">Mi 7:16</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be silent</em>, always of God’s keeping silence when men pray <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:22\" href=\"/Psalms.35.22\">ψ 35:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:3\" href=\"/Psalms.50.3\">50:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:2\" href=\"/Psalms.83.2\">83:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:1\" href=\"/Psalms.109.1\">109:1</a>; sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל־</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:13\" href=\"/Psalms.39.13\">39:13</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be deaf</em>, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִמֶּנִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:1\" href=\"/Psalms.28.1\">ψ 28:1</a>; subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">אָזְנַיִם</span> <a data-re