27</a> v. infr.); <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲרִישִׁים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.11\">2 S 19:11</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>be silent</em> (= <em>exhibit silence</em>)"},{"senses":[{"definition":"almost always of men <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:21\" href=\"/Genesis.24.21\">Gn 24:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:5\" href=\"/Genesis.34.5\">34:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:14\" href=\"/Exodus.14.14\">Ex 14:14</a> (all J), <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:19\" href=\"/Judges.18.19\">Ju 18:19</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.20\">2 S 13:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.11\">19:11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:36\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.36\">2 K 18:36</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.21\">Is 36:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.19\">Je 4:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:24\" href=\"/Job.6.24\">Jb 6:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 13:5\" href=\"/Job.13.5\">13:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 13:13\" href=\"/Job.13.13\">13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 13:19\" href=\"/Job.13.19\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 33:31\" href=\"/Job.33.31\">33:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 33:33\" href=\"/Job.33.33\">33</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:12\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.12\">Pr 11:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.28\">17:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 32:3\" href=\"/Psalms.32.3\">ψ 32:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.8\">Ne 5:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 4:14\" href=\"/Esther.4.14\">Est 4:14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 7:4\" href=\"/Esther.7.4\">7:4</a>; also <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְהִי כְּמַחֲרִישׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 10:27\" href=\"/I_Samuel.10.27\">1 S 10:27</a> (but read rather <span dir=\"rtl\">ויהי כְּמֵחֹדֶשׁ</span> <em>and it came to pass after about a month</em>, 𝔊 Dr); <span dir=\"rtl\">יחרישׁ באהבתו</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 3:17\" href=\"/Zephaniah.3.17\">Zp 3:17</a> (𝔊 𝔖 <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחַדֵּשׁ</span> he <em>will renew</em> 